## Context

Child of tickets/1004, blocked by 1005 (capture lands before teardown —
no recording gap). Spec §8-§10 is authoritative for what dies and what
survives.

## Actions

1. Thin the reviewers skill to descriptor only (spec §8): keep
   needs-description, Padmé/OpenRouter live route docs, fail-open live
   semantics; move seat-runner, benchmark board and replay logic to the
   separate coaching skill; drop panel.yml roster governance,
   scorecard/scores/trial machinery, gaze auto request/harvest wiring.
   Rewrite its scope statement: offers external routes; coaching and
   board replay live in the coaching skill and attribution.
2. Celebrations teardown (spec §9): delete roar step 2, the roar-last-sha
   sentinel, log-celebration, both telemetry tests, the
   CLAUDE_TELEMETRY_DIR seam. enumerate-merges.py migrates to 1007 first.
   Leave events.jsonl and permission-diffs/ untouched. Optional one-time
   archive of celebrations.jsonl (only exact roar-run timestamps are
   unrecoverable).
3. Ticket dispositions: close 0980 WONTDO (seat-each-runtime premise
   dropped); close 0356 (absorbed by 1008); close 0205 with
   integration-review note cross-referencing 1004 and the spec; one
   annotation log line on each closed trial ticket
   (0206/0207/0217/0208/0346/0348/0353) pointing at the spec;
   scorecards are historical evidence, never deleted.
4. Rewrite the rules/workflow.md decorrelation rule off the seat
   mechanism (keep the gradient: sibling tier minimum, different
   vendor/harness stronger, most-decorrelated available for the risk).

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Reviewers skill passes its reduced test suite; no roster/trial
      machinery remains
- [ ] Celebration telemetry no longer written; grep clean for
      log-celebration and the sentinel
- [ ] 0980 and 0205 closed with reasons; closed trial tickets annotated
- [ ] No capture gap: attribution records exist for every merge reviewed
      after 1005 landed

## Raid annotation (2026-10-03, imagine pass)
PREMISE: Holds; all artifacts exist at the cited locations and the capture-before-teardown gate is real (1005/1006/1007 open). 0205/0356 already closed (2026-10-03 pass) — the action-3 items for them are verifications; 0980 open; none of the seven closed trial tickets carries the spec-annotation line yet. Complete deletion/move/reword inventory: (1) delete roar step 2 (`SKILL.md:59-121` incl. fenced block) + line 25 telemetry sentence; (2) delete `skills/roar/log-celebration` (carries the `CLAUDE_TELEMETRY_DIR` seam); (3) `enumerate-merges.py`: 1007 migrates it to `scripts/` first — 1009 deletes the original only after; (4) delete `tests/test_roar_step2_attribution.py` (sole `CLAUDE_TELEMETRY_DIR` setter, :198) and `tests/test_roar_enumerate_merges.py` (follows the script); (5) reword — not in the body, forced by box 2's grep-clean — `skills/lair/SKILL.md:16` (step 0 reads roar-last-sha) and `skills/roar/check-close-claims.sh:18-21` (sentinel comment); (6) reviewers thinning per the §8 table — MOVE to a new coaching skill: `scripts/seat-runner.sh` + `scripts/seat-runner/` (containment wrapper for untrusted external CLI replay — survives, it moves), `reviewers.sh` replay/board logic, `benchmark-board.yml` + `tests/test_benchmark_board.sh` (path update), `references/{request,harvest,audition}.md`, `padme-reviewers.sh` (judgment call: the route docs stay, the runner moves — flag for author); DROP: `panel.yml`, `references/{scorecard,scores}.md`, the promotion pipeline in `references/audition.md`, the scorecard/scores verbs, `tests/{test_reviewers.sh (or reduce to the surviving surface), test_reviewers_audition.sh, test_seat_runner.sh, test_net_relay.py, test_padme_direct_client.py, test_padme_reviewers.sh}`; KEEP in `skills/reviewers/`: needs-description + contract prose, Padmé/OpenRouter live route docs, fail-open semantics; (7) gaze (`SKILL.md:725-807`): delete "When seats fire" / "How" + REVIEWERS_REPO / "Panel integrity (0393)" / "Scorecard (the trial)" / "Advisory